DASH.glossary.hl={m:"Breadth",d:"New highs = NYSE stocks at a 52-week high; new lows = at a 52-week low. Index up while lows still dominate = a narrow bounce. Latest session (Mon 23 Nov): 14 highs vs 146 lows (WSJ), far fewer lows than Friday's 565 (the most in our chart, which starts 6 Oct) as the S&P jumped 4.7%. Lows have still beaten highs on every session this month except 4 Nov; more highs than lows would be the first real sign of healing."};

